description=Production of the Peugeot 206 at Iran Khodro began in 2001, and initially the car was offered in four types: 1, 2, 3, and 4. Later, types 5 and 6 were added to the series, and types 1 and 4 were eliminated. Now, after about two decades, only types 2 , 3 and 5 of the Peugeot 206 are on the production line, and the remaining models have been replaced with other options or completely eliminated from the production program.
